* `S4.Def_RP_EtPBC_A_O2Gd`: S4-EtPBC-A, O2 M6 (O2Gd): one-point classes at a GOOD point are sums of point classes
* `S4.Def_RP_EtPBC_A_PBCStk`: S4-EtPBC-A, L1g: proper base change on stalks from the germ conditions
-/

